ref=\"#E37-MJMAIN-66\" x=\"863\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E37-MJMAIN-69\" x=\"1169\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E37-MJMAIN-63\" x=\"1448\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E37-MJMAIN-69\" x=\"1892\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E37-MJMAIN-65\" x=\"2171\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E37-MJMAIN-6E\" x=\"2615\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E37-MJMAIN-74\" x=\"3172\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E37-MJMAIN-21D2\" x=\"4701\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E37-MJMAINB-4E\" x=\"6201\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(7102,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E37-MJMAIN-65\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E37-MJMAIN-63\" x=\"444\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E37-MJMAIN-65\" x=\"889\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E37-MJMAIN-73\" x=\"1333\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E37-MJMAIN-73\" x=\"1728\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E37-MJMAIN-61\" x=\"2122\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E37-MJMAIN-72\" x=\"2623\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E37-MJMAIN-79\" x=\"3015\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E37-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"10646\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span>  </p>\n<p>Let's look at some examples:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>Consider the following true implication:\n<span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"20.295ex\" height=\"2.676ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1006.6 8738.1 1152.1\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-38-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-38-Title\">\na &gt; 0\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad a^2 &gt; 0\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E38-MJMATHI-61\" d=\"M33 157Q33 258 109 349T280 441Q331 441 370 392Q386 422 416 422Q429 422 439 414T449 394Q449 381 412 234T374 68Q374 43 381 35T402 26Q411 27 422 35Q443 55 463 131Q469 151 473 152Q475 153 483 153H487Q506 153 506 144Q506 138 501 117T481 63T449 13Q436 0