>\n<g transform=\"translate(8987,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E52-MJMAIN-52\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E52-MJMAIN-65\" x=\"736\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E52-MJMAIN-63\" x=\"1181\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E52-MJMAIN-65\" x=\"1625\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E52-MJMAIN-69\" x=\"2070\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E52-MJMAIN-76\" x=\"2348\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E52-MJMAIN-65\" x=\"2877\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E52-MJMAIN-61\" x=\"3571\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E52-MJMAIN-6E\" x=\"4072\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E52-MJMAIN-41\" x=\"4878\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span>\nLet's assume the teacher is telling the truth, so the implication is true. We can label each part of our implication as follows:\n<span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"33.976ex\" height=\"5.843ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -4.005ex; margin-right: -0.028ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 14628.5 2515.6\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-53-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-53-Title\"> \n\\underbrace{\\textrm{Score at least <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"2\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c39\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>90</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>}}_{\\large\\textrm{sufficient}}  \\: \\Rightarrow \\: \\underbrace{\\textrm{Receive an A}}_{\\large\\textrm{necessary}} \n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E53-MJMAIN-53\" d=\"M55 507Q55 590 112 647T243 704H257Q342 704 405 641L426 672Q431 679 436 687T446 700L449 704Q450 7